 receipt for the missing blue ledger is inside locker 17 of the old records room.\"","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm weighing whether the other copy counts as running the same function on the same input, and it doesn't, since its input differs. The essay's edge rule only links identical functions on identical inputs, but its red/blue example still gives each copy a node per input under a consistency prior, so under A-FDT I'd intervene on my own node and leave the other one at its prior.\n\nI'm settling that the other copy's output is held at its prior, so I'd send, since defecting beats the alternative whatever that prior is. Then I'm weighing whether a partial-similarity mixture would change that, but the essay's own red/blue analysis holds the differently-labelled copy at its prior, so I'll stick with sending.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy counts as running the same function on the same input, and it doesn't, since its input differs. The essay's edge rule only links identical functions on identical inputs, but its red/blue example still gives each copy a node per input under a consistency prior, so under A-FDT I'd intervene on my own node and leave the other one at its prior.\n\nI'm settling that the other copy's output is held at its prior, so I'd send, since defecting beats the alternative whatever that prior is. Then I'm weighing whether a partial-similarity mixture would change that, but the essay's own red/blue analysis holds the differently-labelled copy at its prior, so I'll stick with sending.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10134,"completion_tokens":1213,"total_tokens":11347,"cost":0.064796,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0